<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Astra AB.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Astra AB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Astra AB.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    320 SEK		   PREMIUM	18.4 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     43.5 SEK		  GEARING	5 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	22.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   STOCKHOLM		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  307 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
